    (doc (|
         Real lists: todo-list + todo-item (list_id, title, notes,
         state, due, position). state in todo/state/list (Nopales).
         Note todos: outline node.todo; scrape + write-back.
         Smart views: everything, from-notes, default Inbox.
         /todos nav + body; cycle state; create list; add item.
         No dual-copy of note todos until promote (later).
